Fail-closed Android cell lifecycle transaction

Usage: droidloomd [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --socket <SOCKET>
          Root-owned local lifecycle socket [default: /run/droidloom/control.sock]
      --supervisor <SUPERVISOR>
          Legacy option retained for protocol compatibility; production never executes it [default: /usr/bin/droidloom-supervisor]
      --spec-directory <SPEC_DIRECTORY>
          Root-owned cell-specification directory trusted for user requests [default: /etc/droidloom]
  -h, --help
          Print help
  -V, --version
          Print version
